Package: plankannot
Type: Package
Title: Functional Annotation of Plankton Taxonomic Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Mariangela Santorsola
Maintainer: The package maintainer <yourself@somewhere.net>
Description: Provides tools for parsing and functionally annotating
    plankton taxonomic datasets using curated ecological databases.
    Taxonomic records can be matched against functional information
    for groups including phytoplankton, mixoplankton, harmful algal
    bloom taxa, and copepods
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/msantorsola/plankannot
BugReports: https://github.com/msantorsola/plankannot/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
